Third-party notices for eggbot
==============================

eggbot source is MIT (see LICENSE). Dependencies in go.mod are under their
own permissive licenses. None are copyleft (no GPL, LGPL, AGPL, or SSPL).

This is a source tree. Users build with `go build` / `make`; we do not ship
prebuilt binaries. `go build` fetches modules, and each module keeps its own
LICENSE in the module cache. This file is a convenience index of those terms.

Python plugins use only the Python standard library (CPython is not bundled).
Lua runs in-process via gopher-lua; Lua.org sources are not bundled.

